    },
    {
      "id": "ol5QKwLiq0Z4e8s7LtvZR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 496.7533494992365,
      "y": 79.60015481735127,
      "width": 1166,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 189897376,
      "version": 1350,
      "versionNonce": 1385275271,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785291021603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Langchain is an open source framework that helps in building LLM based applications. It provides\nmodular components and end to end tools that help developers build complex AI applications such\nas chatbots, question-answering-systems, retrieval-augmented-generation(RAG), autonomous agents and\nmore.\n\n1. Supports all the major LLMs -> OpenAI GPT models, Entropic's Claude models, Google's Gemini models,\n        Opensource models that are in Huggingface\n2. Simplifies developing LLM based applications -> chains, \n3. Integrations available for all major tools -> we can connect with database, work with remote datasource\n      or need to connect with AWS for deployment we can do these things easily with the help of Langchain\n      wrappperrs.\n4. Open source/ Free / Actively developed\n5. Supports all major GenAI use cases. -> Chatbots, Agents, RAG based applications\n\nUsing Langchain we can get flavour of other things as well like Prompt Engineering, RAG, LLMOps, Agents.\nSo this is good starting point.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Langchain is an open source framework that helps in building LLM based applications. It provides\nmodular components and end to end tools that help developers build complex AI applications such\nas chatbots, question-answering-systems, retrieval-augmented-generation(RAG), autonomous agents and\nmore.\n\n1. Supports all the major LLMs -> OpenAI GPT models, Entropic's Claude models, Google's Gemini models,\n        Opensource models that are in Huggingface\n2. Simplifies developing LLM based applications -> chains, \n3. Integrations available for all major tools -> we can connect with database, work with remote datasource\n      or need to connect with AWS for deployment we can do these things easily with the help of Langchain\n      wrappperrs.\n4. Open source/ Free / Actively developed\n5. Supports all major GenAI use cases. -> Chatbots, Agents, RAG based applications\n\nUsing Langchain we can get flavour of other things as well like Prompt Engineering, RAG, LLMOps, Agents.\nSo this is good starting point.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
