      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785291021603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Fundamental\n    What is Langchain\n    Langchain components\n    Models\n    Prompts\n    Parsing Outputs\n    Runnables and  LCEL\n    Chains\n    Memory\n\n2. RAG\n    Document Loaders\n    Text Splitters\n    Embeddings\n    Vector Stores\n    Retrievers\n    Building a RAG Application\n\n3. Agents\n    Tools and Toolkits\n    Tool Calling\n    Building an AI agent",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 Fundamental\n    What is Langchain\n    Langchain components\n    Models\n    Prompts\n    Parsing Outputs\n    Runnables and  LCEL\n    Chains\n    Memory\n\n2. RAG\n    Document Loaders\n    Text Splitters\n    Embeddings\n    Vector Stores\n    Retrievers\n    Building a RAG Application\n\n3. Agents\n    Tools and Toolkits\n    Tool Calling\n    Building an AI agent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
